# The deploy build's output (scripts/build-site.mjs). Built fresh for every deploy, never committed.
# (Kept at the top of this file so it merges cleanly beside the patterns other branches add below.)
_site/
_site-*/

# Local pre-change backups made before each build wave — kept on disk, not in git.
.index.pre-*.html

# The repo is public. Printouts, exports and photos from the pack almost always carry children's
# names (Trail's End reports, the Ideal Year PDF, rosters, event photos), so none of them are
# tracked. Nothing the site serves is one of these types today; if an image is ever needed, add
# a negation for that one file (e.g. !icon.png) rather than removing a line here.
#
# Every pattern is written case-blind ([Pp][Dd][Ff]) because a phone or a Windows export saves
# IMG_0412.JPG and REPORT.PDF, and pattern matching here is case-sensitive on Linux and on a
# case-sensitive disk. Plain text, GIF and binary Excel are here too (2026-09-28): a pasted
# roster or a Trail's End export saved as .txt is exactly as full of names as the .csv.
*.[Pp][Dd][Ff]
*.[Cc][Ss][Vv]
*.[Xx][Ll][Ss][Xx]
*.[Xx][Ll][Ss]
*.[Nn][Uu][Mm][Bb][Ee][Rr][Ss]
*.[Pp][Nn][Gg]
*.[Jj][Pp][Gg]
*.[Jj][Pp][Ee][Gg]
*.[Hh][Ee][Ii][Cc]
*.[Tt][Ss][Vv]
*.[Xx][Ll][Ss][Mm]
*.[Oo][Dd][Ss]
*.[Dd][Oo][Cc]
*.[Dd][Oo][Cc][Xx]
*.[Pp][Aa][Gg][Ee][Ss]
*.[Ww][Ee][Bb][Pp]
*.[Hh][Ee][Ii][Ff]
*.[Mm][Oo][Vv]
*.[Mm][Pp]4
*.[Tt][Xx][Tt]
*.[Gg][Ii][Ff]
*.[Xx][Ll][Ss][Bb]

# The app's own downloads. A backup (popcorn-backup.json) or a year-close snapshot
# (pack-year-*-snapshot.json) is the WHOLE pack record — every child, every family's money,
# leaders' contact details. Calendar, contact, zip, rich-text and saved-email exports carry
# names too. No tracked file is any of these today; if one ever has to be, negate just that file.
*.[Jj][Ss][Oo][Nn]
*.[Ii][Cc][Ss]
*.[Zz][Ii][Pp]
*.[Vv][Cc][Ff]
*.[Rr][Tt][Ff]
*.[Ee][Mm][Ll]
